# Brygid the Stylist (bastok 44): Brygid in Bastok Markets. The offer (310), 310 again until a Robe and a Bronze Subligar
# are worn together (each piece alone is not enough), the Gloves reward, no repeat. The quest has no trade handler. A
# MNK: a WAR cannot wear the Robe.
# Brygid's default is 119; Brygid the Stylist Returns (also on Brygid) needs artifact armor worn, which this char never
# wears.
lists BastokMarkets/Brygid/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Brygid/onTrade BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/310 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/311
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-90.2,-4.302,-107.5 job=MNK lvl=10
item Robe
item BronzeSubligar
item BoneChip
login
trade Brygid BoneChip x1        # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Brygid                  # the offer, 310
finish                          # accepted
trigger Brygid                  # accepted, nothing worn: 310 again
finish                          # no change
equip Robe Body
trigger Brygid                  # the Robe only: 310
finish
trade Brygid BoneChip x1        # accepted: no trade handler, nothing
equip BronzeSubligar Legs
trigger Brygid                  # the Robe and the Bronze Subligar: 311
finish                          # completed: Gloves, fame +20, Brygid-Approved
trigger Brygid                  # completed: her default 119
finish
